      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
      "created_at": "2024-12-26T20:12:15.012Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Okay, so I don’t use Spotify or any of those other sites that have a ‘wrapped’, but for some reason I felt like making a list of my top ten episodes from this year? I don’t know why?? And it took a long time even though I was just listening to the issue/creative part???</p>\n<p>Anyway, in episode order, though I’ll say, since I had to rank them to make sure I only had 10, Deathfiend was my <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#1</span>, over Wipeout. But again, in airing order, with a little tag to remind me which was which:</p>\n<p>272 - Mystery Comics Vol. 2 <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#485</span> (Serpentimes)<br>\n276 - Freedom Five <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#431</span> (Cryptic Glues)<br>\n279 - Cosmic Tales Vol. 2 <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#533</span> (Greazer &amp; Fashion vs. Card Shark)<br>\n280 - Disparation Vol. 2 <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#122</span> (end of the Oracle of Discord)<br>\n282 - ADITL Fanatic<br>\n288 - Tome of the Bizarre Vol. 3 <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#4</span> (The Death and Return of Skeleton Key)<br>\n285 - Wipeout <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#1-4</span><br>\n292 - Cosmic Tales Vol. 2 <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#525</span> &amp; <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#526</span> (Sky-Scraper, Fashion and Ruin)<br>\n296 - Mystery Comics Vol. 2 <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#278</span> (Darkstrife vs. Painstake with Blaze Savage)<br>\n301 - Who is Deathfiend?</p>\n<p>What’s yours? <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2024-12-26T20:12:15.012Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
