      "user_title": "",
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "Okay, so I don't use Spotify or any of those other sites that have a 'wrapped', but for some reason I felt like making a list of my top ten episodes from this year? I don't know why?? And it took a long time even though I was just listening to the issue/creative part???\n\nAnyway, in episode order, though I'll say, since I had to rank them to make sure I only had 10, Deathfiend was my #1, over Wipeout. But again, in airing order, with a little tag to remind me which was which:\n\n272 - Mystery Comics Vol. 2 #485 (Serpentimes)\n276 - Freedom Five #431 (Cryptic Glues)\n279 - Cosmic Tales Vol. 2 #533 (Greazer & Fashion vs. Card Shark)\n280 - Disparation Vol. 2 #122 (end of the Oracle of Discord)\n282 - ADITL Fanatic\n288 - Tome of the Bizarre Vol. 3 #4 (The Death and Return of Skeleton Key)\n285 - Wipeout #1-4\n292 - Cosmic Tales Vol. 2 #525 & #526 (Sky-Scraper, Fashion and Ruin)\n296 - Mystery Comics Vol. 2 #278 (Darkstrife vs. Painstake with Blaze Savage)\n301 - Who is Deathfiend?\n\nWhat's yours? :D",
