      "created_at": "2024-12-26T20:24:49.045Z",
      "cooked": "<p><em>Weeeell</em>, let’s see, here’s mine:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Episode <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#272:</span> Writers’ Room — <em>Mystery Comics</em> Vol. 2 <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#485:</span> Stuntman vs. Night Snake</li>\n<li>Episode <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#274:</span> Writers’ Room — <em>Cosmic Tales</em> Vol. 2 <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#107-</span><span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#108:</span> Baron Blade’s space-magic plot</li>\n<li>Episode <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#273:</span> Writers’ Room — <em>Arcane Tales</em> Vol. 2 <span class=\"hashtag-raw\">#613:</span> Lifeline &amp; Waykeep</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Because I’m super behind and those three are the only 2024 episodes that I’ve hitherto listened to. : / Nonetheless, I can still rank them, I guess. (Weird that they’re all Volume 2s.)</p>",
