      "raw": "*Weeeell*, let's see, here's mine:\n1. Episode #272: Writers' Room --- *Mystery Comics* Vol. 2 #485: Stuntman vs. Night Snake\n2. Episode #274: Writers' Room --- *Cosmic Tales* Vol. 2 #107-#108: Baron Blade's space-magic plot\n3. Episode #273: Writers' Room --- *Arcane Tales* Vol. 2 #613: Lifeline & Waykeep\n\nBecause I'm super behind and those three are the only 2024 episodes that I've hitherto listened to. : / Nonetheless, I can still rank them, I guess. (Weird that they're all Volume 2s.)",
