      "id": 261868,
      "name": "Casey",
      "username": "TheRealPeacockTalk",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/dec6dc/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2024-12-28T04:43:12.636Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Deathfiend was fabulous, which I credit entirely to how it allowed us so much historical context across a larger scope of Sentinels history compared to some other stories. Cryptic Glues was definitely my number one of the regular writers rooms experiences. I also enjoyed Day in the Life of Argent Adept, and Greazer and Fashion vs. Card Shark, and Bunker in Space.</p>\n<p>So, I guess it’s</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Deathfiend.</li>\n<li>Cryptic Glues.</li>\n<li>Greazer and Fashion vs. Card Shark</li>\n<li>ADITL: Argent Adept</li>\n<li>Bunker in Space</li>\n<li>The Death and Life of Skeleton Blade</li>\n<li>Skyscraper and Fashion team up</li>\n<li>Villains during OblivAeon</li>\n<li>Stuntman vs Nightsnake</li>\n<li>Lifeline meets Waykeep</li>\n</ol>",
      "post_number": 3,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2024-12-28T04:59:17.422Z",
      "reply_count": 1,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
