      "raw": "Deathfiend was fabulous, which I credit entirely to how it allowed us so much historical context across a larger scope of Sentinels history compared to some other stories. Cryptic Glues was definitely my number one of the regular writers rooms experiences. I also enjoyed Day in the Life of Argent Adept, and Greazer and Fashion vs. Card Shark, and Bunker in Space.\n\nSo, I guess it's\n\n1. Deathfiend.\n2. Cryptic Glues.\n3. Greazer and Fashion vs. Card Shark\n4. ADITL: Argent Adept\n5. Bunker in Space\n6. The Death and Life of Skeleton Blade\n7. Skyscraper and Fashion team up\n8. Villains during OblivAeon\n9. Stuntman vs Nightsnake\n10. Lifeline meets Waykeep",
