      "created_at": "2024-12-31T21:08:46.744Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"TheRealPeacockTalk\" data-post=\"8\" data-topic=\"31241\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/dec6dc/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> TheRealPeacockTalk:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Was ADITL Unity really this year?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>The Twitter thread was the covers he drew in 2024, and that was the one “pre-Writer’s Room Writer’s Room” cover he caught up on. So IIRC the one non-2024 episode he did a 2024 cover for. (Still wish he’d stayed on doing that catching up…)</p>\n<p>i’m kind of behind on the newer eps, but my Top Ten of this year is probably this:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Stuntman vs Nightsnake</li>\n<li>Cryptic Glues</li>\n<li>ADITL: Argent Adept</li>\n<li>Bunker in Space</li>\n<li>Wipeout’s Series</li>\n<li>Queen Kismet</li>\n<li>Rambler vs Biomancer</li>\n<li>Time-Travelling Legacy</li>\n<li>Young Legacy vs Baron Blade</li>\n<li>The “Villains During OblivAeon” Creative Process</li>\n</ul>",
